msgid "More than twenty years after Grunwald the king hired the Czechs, the very ones who burned churches at home. Pan Jan said that his great-grandfather Jaśko, grey already, went with them to the sea and to his death could not decide what there was more of in that march: glory or shame."
msgstr "More than twenty years after Grunwald the king hired the Czechs, the very ones who burned churches at home. Pan Jan said that his great-grandfather Jaśko, grey already, went with them to the sea and to his death could not decide what there was more of in that march: glory or shame."

msgid "Morning. The king's camp before Chojnice. Hundreds of tents, the smoke of fires, horses neighing. An old man in old-fashioned armour sits on a block of wood and whets his sword. Beside him a youth in a new breastplate tries how the pauldron moves on its straps."
msgstr "Morning. The king's camp before Chojnice. Hundreds of tents, the smoke of fires, horses neighing. An old man in old-fashioned armour sits on a block of wood and whets his sword. Beside him a youth in a new breastplate tries how the pauldron moves on its straps."

msgid "Mother of God, Virgin, by God glorified Mary..."
msgstr "Mother of God, Virgin, by God glorified Mary..."

msgid "Mother sang this over the flax. I never thought men went to die to it."
msgstr "Mother sang this over the flax. I never thought men went to die to it."

msgid "Mother, let me go. I know the passage to the river, it was built in father's time."
msgstr "Mother, let me go. I know the passage to the river, it was built in father's time."

