msgid "Muscovites. Let them sort it out among themselves."
msgstr "Muscovites. Let them sort it out among themselves."

msgid "Must stand in the forest"
msgstr "Must stand in the forest"

msgid "My grandfather made a bargain with somebody, that is true. But treasures have nothing to do with it. This is the silver of the Gdańsk merchants, and they want it back with interest. I am a merchant's wife, father, I know: the devil takes no interest."
msgstr "My grandfather made a bargain with somebody, that is true. But treasures have nothing to do with it. This is the silver of the Gdańsk merchants, and they want it back with interest. I am a merchant's wife, father, I know: the devil takes no interest."

msgid "My great-grandfather Gintaut burned a German castle and hid a grove. My grandfather Mikołaj stood against his own brother. Andrei served a prince who broke his oath and sought no excuses. And the groves I wrote of have been cut down or fenced in with church walls. They say the fire went under the earth. I do not believe it. But I wrote it down, because that is what they say."
msgstr "My great-grandfather Gintaut burned a German castle and hid a grove. My grandfather Mikołaj stood against his own brother. Andrei served a prince who broke his oath and sought no excuses. And the groves I wrote of have been cut down or fenced in with church walls. They say the fire went under the earth. I do not believe it. But I wrote it down, because that is what they say."

