msgid "Oliwa is burning. There is the abbey, pan Jaśko, there are holy relics."
msgstr "Oliwa is burning. There is the abbey, pan Jaśko, there are holy relics."

msgid "On 13 September a truce was made at Jasieniec, and in December at Łęczyca it was extended for twelve years. Twenty-one years later Jaśko went to Prussia again, and that time he did not take the bottle with him."
msgstr "On 13 September a truce was made at Jasieniec, and in December at Łęczyca it was extended for twelve years. Twenty-one years later Jaśko went to Prussia again, and that time he did not take the bottle with him."

msgid "On that place the prince ordered a church of the Holy Trinity to be built. And the village by the church people called the Slaughter, Pabaiskas in our tongue. After that day neither Švitrigaila nor the Germans came against Vilnius again. That winter at Brest the Order promised to support him no more."
msgstr "On that place the prince ordered a church of the Holy Trinity to be built. And the village by the church people called the Slaughter, Pabaiskas in our tongue. After that day neither Švitrigaila nor the Germans came against Vilnius again. That winter at Brest the Order promised to support him no more."

