msgstr "On the road: %s florins"

msgid "On the twenty-eighth of November the Samogitians came to Konstanz. In February their complaint against the Order was read to the council. The Order answered: the baptism is shallow, and Vytautas stirs up the Samogitians."
msgstr "On the twenty-eighth of November the Samogitians came to Konstanz. In February their complaint against the Order was read to the council. The Order answered: the baptism is shallow, and Vytautas stirs up the Samogitians."

msgid "On to Tczew. Mikołaj leads the army to the third camp before the town."
msgstr "On to Tczew. Mikołaj leads the army to the third camp before the town."

msgid "On your knees, gentlemen! Whoever has come to the sea shall rise a knight."
msgstr "On your knees, gentlemen! Whoever has come to the sea shall rise a knight."

