msgid "Łukasz Górka"
msgstr "Łukasz Górka"

msgid "Łęczyca, spring. An old house. On a shelf stands a cloudy bottle of Baltic water. Stach hangs his sabre beside it, steps back and looks for a long time."
msgstr "Łęczyca, spring. An old house. On a shelf stands a cloudy bottle of Baltic water. Stach hangs his sabre beside it, steps back and looks for a long time."

msgid "Świecino"
msgstr "Świecino"

msgid "Świecino by Lake Żarnowiec, Gdańsk Pomerania. 17 September 1462, the night before the battle and the whole day."
msgstr "Świecino by Lake Żarnowiec, Gdańsk Pomerania. 17 September 1462, the night before the battle and the whole day."

msgid "Świecino is won. Raweneck is dead, his wagon fort taken, and the war has turned. The Crown campaign is over."
msgstr "Świecino is won. Raweneck is dead, his wagon fort taken, and the war has turned. The Crown campaign is over."

msgid "Švitrigaila has brought Tatars too. Light horse to the northern edge, and let them not get off their horses until morning."
msgstr "Švitrigaila has brought Tatars too. Light horse to the northern edge, and let them not get off their horses until morning."

msgid "Švitrigaila's army is beaten at Vilkomir."
msgstr "Švitrigaila's army is beaten at Vilkomir."

msgid "Švitrigaila's patrol holds the spring on the island. Drive it off and stand at the spring to take it."
msgstr "Švitrigaila's patrol holds the spring on the island. Drive it off and stand at the spring to take it."
